Setup checklist
Download and Install Arduino IDE.
Once installed, open the Arduino IDE.
Configure Preferences::
On Windows or Linux, select File → Preferences from the main application toolbar.
On MacOS, select Arduino IDE → Settings from the main application tool bar.
In the Preferences panel, add M5Stack's Board Manager URL by copying-and-pasting the following line into the blank text input area:
https://static-cdn.m5stack.com/resource/arduino/package_m5stack_index.json
Screenshot of the preferences panel in Arduino IDE
Whilst the Preferences window is open, tick the checkboxes for:
Verify code after Upload
Show verbose output during compilation and upload
If the above checkboxes are not available to you, simply move on from this step for now.
Close the preferences window by clicking "OK".
Select Tools → Board → Board Manager... . In Board Manager, type StampC3 into the blank text input area, wait for the list to update. Click "install" on the entry for the M5Stack board package. This is a large package and may take some time to download and install. Once installed, click "close".
Screenshot of the boards manager panel in Arduino IDE
Select Tools → Board → M5Stack Arduino → M5StampC3.
Illustration of the basic interfaces to the StampC3

Set Tools → USB-CDC On Boot → Disabled.
Illustration of the basic interfaces to the StampC3

Install Libraries: We also require two library packages to operate the IMU sensor on board the Pololu 3Pi+ robot. These are LIS3MDL and LSM6.
Select Sketch → Include Library → Manage Libraries.
Screenshot of the libraries manager panel in Arduino IDE
In the search field, enter LIS3MDL, wait for the list panel to update. Find the library named "lis3mdl" and click install.
Screenshot of the libraries manager panel in Arduino IDE
In the search field, enter LIS3MDL, wait for the list panel to update. Find the library named "lsm6" and click install.
Screenshot of the libraries manager panel in Arduino IDE
Click close to finish installing libraries.
If you have an issue using the Serial port or uploading to the StampC3, you may need to perform the following step.

Optional: Change Upload Speed to 115200. If you have trouble uploading to the StampC3, this is recommended. You can try leaving this at 921600 to begin with.